      "created_at": "2015-01-18T22:07:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Many enhancement cards are required to be played next to other cards. &nbsp;Chronoranger's Bounties, or Captain Cosmic's Constructs, for example. &nbsp;Are there limitations on how many cards may be played next to another card, and if so what is that limit? &nbsp;For example:</p><p><span>During his Play Phase, Captain Cosmic plays Cosmic Weapon from his hand. &nbsp;He places it to the right of Legacy's character card. &nbsp;During Captain Cosmic's Power Phase he reveals Autonomous Blade; now that Legacy has a way to deal damage he wants to place Autonomous Blade on Legacy. &nbsp;Can the card be placed to the right of Legacy (currently occupied by Cosmic Weapon)? &nbsp;If not, can it be placed to the left of Legacy?</span></p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:26.085Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
